{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方大字号、高亮白色的长段落首先吸引视线，尤其是第一行；右上角粉色阶段目录较小，下方暗金色音符动画亮度较低，都是次要入口。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他正和另一个人处于亲近的相处中，暂时不想考虑两个人的未来，只想享受当下。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"舒服、放松、享受亲近。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他其实有心动和表达喜欢的冲动，却没能开口；之后思绪逐渐漂远，情绪和声音都出现了迟滞、沉落。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"单块文字较长，一块里连续包含舒适亲近、心动、想表达却没开口、思绪漂散等多层意思。\",\n    \"后半段的情绪转折需要继续读，第一眼不容易完整捕捉。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "746437d6-6cf0-4779-9da8-348661e7e9c5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T014137280203Z", "elapsed_seconds": 41.031, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:42:18.316242+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b8deb4fcd0744240516f558d3e847ee044f6a4a1805eac9b4352e6560e827cc5", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa2388500